<title>RUSSIA: Russia cuts non-resident govt securities yield.</title>
<headline>Russia cuts non-resident govt securities yield.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia will cut the average yield on government Treasury Bills and OFZ bonds for non-residents to 12.5 percent from 13 percent beginning January 16, the Central Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The indicative yield on operations for foreigners with government securities will be cut to 12.5 percent beginning January 16,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
</text>
